@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F4F8FD
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2B6CB0
title Workflow CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml)

start
:push в main / pull request в main / вручную;
fork
  :**Lint**
  rustfmt --check
  clippy -D warnings
  cargo hakari verify;
fork again
  :**Build & Test (Rust 1.88)**
  кэш ~~/.cargo + target
  cargo build / cargo test;
fork again
  :**Build & Test (Rust stable)**
  кэш ~~/.cargo + target
  cargo build / cargo test;
fork again
  :**Coverage**
  cargo llvm-cov
  артефакт: lcov.info + HTML;
end fork
:**Notify** (if: always())
notify.yml → Telegram / Slack
статус: success / failure;
stop
@enduml
